OL,3,GNEWSAElderly man 'isolated' after 1km
OL,4,Acable theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man in his 80s have
OL,7,Fsaid he has been left "isolated and
OL,8,Fdepressed" after his home phone was cut
OL,9,Foff following a cable theft in
OL,10,FLeicestershire.
OL,12,FOpenreach said about 200 homes were
OL,13,Faffected after roughly 1km (0.62 miles)
OL,14,Fof copper and fibre cable was reported
OL,15,Fstolen in Anstey Lane, Thurcaston, on
OL,16,F14 October.
OL,18,FMeg Grant, the main carer for her
OL,19,Ffather, said the landline was the only
OL,20,Fway of contacting him, and feared he
OL,21,Fwould be left vulnerable in an
OL,22,Femergency.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
