OL,3,GNEWSAElderly man 'isolated' after 1km
OL,4,Acable theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe infrastructure provider said a road
OL,7,Fclosure and traffic management had
OL,8,Fdelayed repairs in the village in
OL,9,FLeicestershire, but added work had now
OL,10,Fbegun with services due to be
OL,11,F"progressively restored".
